</li></ol>'),(503,'2019-01-06','morning','06January2019am','mp3','Motto Text 2019','motto-text-2019','','Mark Drury','Annual motto text','2019-01-20 11:59:49','2019-01-20 11:59:49',''),(504,'2018-12-30','morning','30December2018am','mp3','False Teaching','false-teaching','','Mark Drury','Spiritual depression','2019-01-20 12:00:50','2019-01-20 12:00:50',''),(505,'2018-12-23','morning','23December2018am','mp3','They will call him Immanuel','they-will-call-him-immanuel','','Mark Drury','','2019-01-20 12:01:35','2019-01-20 12:01:35',''),(506,'2019-01-27','morning','27January2019am','mp3','A reputation for life','a-reputation-for-life','Revelation 3:1-6','Gareth Claridge','Revelation: letters to the churches','2019-02-02 21:35:08','2019-02-02 21:35:08',''),(507,'2019-02-03','morning','2February2019am','mp3','Trials','trials','1 Peter 1:1-9','Mark Drury','Spiritual depression','2019-02-03 11:37:41','2019-02-03 11:37:41','<ol><li class=\"h4\">Trials are appointed by God for a reason</li><li class=\"h4\">Some of the reasons why trials come:</li><ul><li>To chastise/discipline us</li><li>To prepare us for something</li><li>To teach us to humbly lean on God</li><li>To mature/perfect us</li><li>To show the genuineness of our fauth</li></ul><li class=\"h4\">Consolation and encouragement as we face trials</li><ul><li>Trials are not permanent</li><li>God knows what we can bear</li><li>Grace is always available</li><li>We can still rejoice</li></ul></ol>'),(508,'2019-02-10','morning','9February2019am','mp3','Chastening','chastening','Hebrews 12:5-11','Mark Drury','Spiritual depression','2019-02-10 11:37:41','2019-02-10 11:37:41','<ol><li class=\"h4\">How does God chasten us?</li><li class=\"h4\">Why does God chasten us?</li></ol>'),(509,'2019-02-10','evening','10February2019pm','mp3','Important words of encouragement','important-words-of-encouragement','1 John 2:12-14','Mark Drury','1 John','2019-02-10 19:49:00','2019-02-10 19:49:00','<ol><li class=\"h4\">They had been forgiven on 