irit breathes  upon the Word','William Cowper 1731-1800','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Bible','Enjoyment and obedience'),(586,'563','Speak, Lord, in the stillness','Emily M Crawford 1868-1927',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Bible','Enjoyment and obedience'),(587,'564','Behold, the mountain of the Lord','Michael Bruce 1746-67','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Character and privileges'),(588,'565','As we are gathered, Jesus is here','John Daniels',NULL,'1979 Word\'s Spirit of Praise Music/Adm. by CopyCare','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Character and privileges'),(589,'566','Be still','David J. Evans',NULL,'1986 Kingsway\'s Thankyou Music','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Character and privileges'),(590,'567','Christ is made the sure foundation','Latin 7th Century Trans John Mason Neale 1818-66','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Character and privileges'),(591,'568','Church of God, elect and glorious','James Seddon 1915-83',NULL,'jubilate hymns','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Character and privileges'),(592,'569','Father, we adore you','Phil Lawson Johnston','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Character and privileges'),(593,'570','Glorious things of you are spoken','John Newton 1725-1807',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Character and privileges'),(594,'571','Head of your church triumphant','Charles Wesley 1707-88',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Character and privileges'),(595,'572','Jesus, come, for we invite you','Christopher Idle',NULL,'author / Jubilate Hymns','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The churc