 of Jesus','James Seddon 1915-83',NULL,'Mrs M Seddon / Jubilate Hymns','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Evangelism and mission'),(651,'628','Tell out, my soul, the greatness of the Lord!','Timothy Dudley-Smith',NULL,'1961 Timothy Dudley-Smith','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Evangelism and mission'),(652,'629','These are the facts as we have received them','Michael Saward','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Evangelism and mission'),(653,'630','We all are one in mission','Rusty Edwards','We all are one in mission;\nWe all are one in call.\nOur varied gifts united\nBy Christ, the Lord of all.\nA single, great commission\nCompels us from above\nTo plan and work together\nThat all may know God','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Evangelism and mission'),(654,'631','We believe in God Almighty','Andrew King',NULL,'Haywards Heath Evangelical Free Church','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Evangelism and mission'),(655,'632','We have a Gospel to proclaim','Edward J. Burns',NULL,'Author','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Evangelism and mission'),(656,'633','How beautiful their feet','Isaac Watts 1674-1748','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Evangelism and mission'),(657,'634','Baptized in water for our Lord','Paul Sayer',NULL,'Author/Praise Trust','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Baptism'),(658,'635','Baptized in water','Michael Saward','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Baptism'),(659,'636','Baptized into Christ Jesus','Christopher Idle','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Baptism'),(660,'637','Jesus, how could I ever be','Joseph Grigg c.1720-68 Benjamin Francis 1734-99','Jesus, how could I ever be\nAshamed of you, who died for me?\nAshamed of you, whom angels praise,\nWhose glories shine through endless days?\n\nAshamed of Jesus, of my God,\nWho purchased me with his own blood?\nOf him who, to retrieve my loss,\nDespised the shame, endured the cross?\n\nAshamed of Jesus, that dear friend\nOn whom my hopes of heaven depend?\nNo, when I blush, be this my shame,\nThat I no more revere his name.\n\nAshamed of Jesus, of my Lord\nBy all heaven','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Baptism'),(661,'638','The servants of God are baptized','Nick Needham','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Baptism'),(662,'639','When Jesus died upon the cross','Peter Misselbrook','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','Baptism'),(663,'640','A feast of joy unspeakable is spread','Malcolm MacGregor',NULL,'Author','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(664,'641','According to your gracious word','James Montgomery 1771-1854',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(665,'642','Among us our beloved stands','Charles H Spurgeon 1834-92',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(666,'643','Bread of the world in mercy broken','Reginald Heber 1783-1826',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(667,'644','Bread of heaven, on you we feed','Josiah Conder 1789-1855','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(668,'645','By Christ redeemed, in Christ restored','Gearge Rawson 1807-89',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(669,'646','Father, we give you thanks, who planted','From the Didache, Greek 2nd Century Trans. F B Tucker 1895','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(670,'647','He gave his life in selfless love','Chris Porteous',NULL,'author / Jubilate Hymns','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(671,'648','Here, O my Lord, may I behold your face','Horatius Bonar 1808-89',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(672,'649','Come, O everlasting Spirit','Charles Wesley 1707-88','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(673,'650','I come with joy, a child of God','Brian Wren','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(674,'651','I hunger and I thirst','J S B Monsell 1811-75','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(675,'652','In memory of the Saviour\'s love','Thomas Cotterill 1779-1823',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(676,'653','Jesus invites his saints','Isaac Watts 1674-1748','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(677,'654','My God, now is your table spread','Philip Doddridge 1702-51','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(678,'655','O God, your mercy, moved by love','J Alec Motyer','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(679,'656','O sacrifice of Calvary','Michael Saward','O sacrifice of Calvary,\nO Lamb whose sacred blood was shed,\nO great High Priest on heaven','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(680,'657','Shepherd of souls, refresh and bless','J B Dykes',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(681,'658','Sit down beneath  his shadow','Frances R Havergal 1836-79',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(682,'659','We come as guests invited','','We come as guests invited\nwhen Jesus bids us dine,\nhis friends on earth united\nto share the bread and wine;\nthe bread of life is broken,\nthe wine is freely poured\nfor us, in solemn token\nof Christ, our dying Lord.\n\nWe eat and drink, receiving\nfrom Christ the grace we need,\nand in our hearts believing\non him by faith we feed;\nwith wonder and thanksgiving\nfor love that knows no end,\nwe find in Jesus living\nour ever-present friend.\n\nOne bread is ours for sharing,\none single fruitful vine,\nour fellowship declaring\nrenewed in bread and wine:\nrenewed, sustained and given\nby token, sign and word,\nthe pledge and seal of heaven,\nthe love of Christ our Lord.\n-+-','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(683,'660','While the bread is yet unbroken','J T Norwood',NULL,'Author','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(684,'661','With this bread we will remember  him','Geoff Baker',NULL,'1994 Sovereign Music UK','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(685,'662','Sweet feast of Love Divine','Edward Denny 1796-1889',NULL,'in this version Praise Trust','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The church','The Lord’s Supper'),(686,'663','O walk with Jesus! You will know','E Paxton Hood 1820-1885',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The gospel','Invitation and warning'),(687,'664','Have you heard the voice of Jesus','W Vernon Higham',NULL,'Author','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The gospel','Invitation and warning'),(688,'665','Christ brings the kingdom wher