ified.\n\nAll for Jesus, all for Jesus!\nThis the church\'s song shall be,\nTill at last his people gather,\nOne in him eternally.\n-+-','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(860,'837','Father, Holy Spirit, Son','Charles Wesley 1707-88','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(861,'838','Fill all my life, O Lord my God','Horatius Bonar 1808-89',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(862,'839','God be in my head','Salisbury Book of Hours 1514','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(863,'840','How blessed is life if lived for you','Prust\'s Supplementary Hymn Book 1869',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(864,'841','How rich and deep God\'s judgements are','Martin E Leckerbusch',NULL,'1999 Kevin Mayhew Ltd','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(865,'842','I bind myself to God today','Patrick c.389-461 Trans. Cecil Frances Alexander 1818-95','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(866,'843','Jesus, I my cross have taken','Henry F Lyte 1793-1847',NULL,'Public Domain','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(867,'844','Jesus, your boundless love to me','Paulus Gerhardt 1607-76 tr. John Wesley 1703-91',NULL,'in this version Praise Trust','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-11 08:57:00',NULL,1,NULL,'The Christian life','Commitment and obedience'),(868,'845','Lift up your heads, you mighty gates','Georg Weissel 1590-1635 Trans. Catherine Winkworth 1827-','','','2016-10-11 08:57:00','2016-10-